						],
						"pointId": 5001
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 740390101,
					"content": "Hmm... A Tidalga slurry, the crushed innards of Lumitoile, and a little... Wait, how much is a \"little\" exactly?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390102,
					"content": "Hey, are you making some soup? ... Urgh, that smells really weird...!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390103,
					"content": "Hmm? It smells weird? That can't be. I followed the formula Carabosse gave me exactly, so it should smell normal...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390104,
						740390106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390104,
					"content": "It smells like someone fermented a sea bass for three years in a vat of dead frogs...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390105
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740390105,
					"content": "Urp, did you have to say that? Now Paimon has that image in her head...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390108,
					"content": "A—Anyway, what are you doing? Do you, uh, need help?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390109,
					"content": "It's a potion! I'm formulating a potion... one that'll help lots of people.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390110,
					"content": "So you're a potioneer, then?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390111,
					"content": "Not yet! I'm just an assistant to a Master Potioneer. Her name is Carabosse, and I, Verenata, still have much to learn from her.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390112,
					"content": "Hehe, well, an assistant to a great doctor must be a great assistant, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390113,
					"content": "Hehe... Ye— W—Wait, no! Not at all!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390114,
					"content": "I'm... There are so many things I still don't know. I'm just working as hard as I can to help her make potions.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390115,
					"content": "Also... U—Um, I've told you my name, but I don't know yours yet.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390116,
					"content": "#Paimon's Paimon, and {M#he's}{F#she's} {NICKNAME}.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390117,
					"content": "\"Paimon.\" What a nice name. Reminds me of a noisy white jellyfish.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390118,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}. That's a slightly strange name, and it gleams like gold, but it's very friendly. Pleased to meet you!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390119,
					"content": "And, well, you just asked if I need help, and I do... But I don't know if you'd be willing to help...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390120,
					"content": "Ask away.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390121
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740390121,
					"content": "Exactly! If you need help, you should just say so!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390122,
					"content": "I'd like you to... try my new potions.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390123,
					"content": "Eh?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390124,
					"content": "I know potions smell and taste bad... but they can help lots of people and cure many illnesses. They're very useful things.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390125,
					"content": "But we can't get sick, and we don't like drinking strange things. Over time, people stopped helping me taste my potions — and that's been a big problem for me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390126,
					"content": "Uh... You're the one who said this stuff is weird! It isn't dangerous, is it?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390127,
					"content": "It's fine. We don't get poisoned by them. Um... so you shouldn't either... Well, at least in theory, anyway.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390128,
					"content": "There are a total of three potions that need testing. One will help people fight better! The other will keep people feeling warm. And the last one, um...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390129,
					"content": "I'm not sure how to put this, but Carabosse says that it can help people understand the truth. That's what she said, anyway... I'm still not sure what it means...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390130,
					"content": "That does sound dangerous...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390131
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390131,
					"content": "No, no, it's not dangerous... Anyway, would you like to help? If you would, I'll take you to the test site now!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390106,
					"content": "If you calm down a bit, you can smell the fragrance of Sweet Flowers...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390107
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740390107,
					"content": "Hey, that's not right either!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
