					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							2501.867,
							445.247,
							4636.573
						],
						"pointId": 4513
					},
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							2501.063,
							445.119,
							4637.081
						],
						"pointId": 5959
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 740390701,
					"content": "#Are you alright, {NICKNAME}? Are you okay!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390702
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390702,
					"content": "Sorry, sorry... I didn't know that the medicine would attract strange things like that...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390703,
						740390710
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390703,
					"content": "That happened because the potion made me all coasty and toasty, you know?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390704
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740390704,
					"content": "Uh, is that even how things work? Can you be coasty?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390705
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390705,
					"content": "Wow... Right! Aquatic animals do mistake warm things for the sun, which will attract them. That means... the potion worked! Thank you both, truly!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390706
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390706,
					"content": "Paimon really doesn't think that's how it works...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390707
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390707,
					"content": "Aquatic animals...? Weren't those Pyro Slimes?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390708
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740390708,
					"content": "I see... Hmm, hallucinogenic side effects... Alright, I've written it down. Well, at least it wasn't completely ineffective, but...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390709
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390709,
					"content": "But its effects were terrible! It made huge crabs look like Pyro Slimes this time, but what if a more dangerous monster comes along next time!? What then?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390720
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390720,
					"content": "True... I've already bothered you so much already, but there's one final potion that needs testing... Are you still okay with that?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390721,
						740390723
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390721,
					"content": "As long as it's not poisonous, let's do it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390722
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740390722,
					"content": "Though we'll only find out if it's poisonous when we test it...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390725
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390725,
					"content": "Yes! Thank you so much! Well, next up is... the Truesight Potion!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390726
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390726,
					"content": "Eh? W—Wait just a minute!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390727
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390727,
					"content": "The first one was the Super-Duper Potion, the next was the Coasty-Toasty Potion, and this one's called...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390728
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390728,
					"content": "The Truesight Potion, which means it can \"let people see the truth\"... What's wrong with that?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390729
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390729,
					"content": "Um... It's nothing... Paimon just thinks that this one's name is completely different compared to the others! It's like a 360 degree turn!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390730,
						740390731
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390730,
					"content": "Doesn't that mean it's no different?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390732
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740390732,
					"content": "Huh...? Uh... Paimon doesn't have that many fingers! You know what Paimon meant anyway!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390733
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390733,
					"content": "Hehe, that's because the Master Potioneer named the first two for me, and I named this one...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390734
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390734,
					"content": "I'm no good at names though, so it's definitely not as good as the names she came up with.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390735
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390735,
					"content": "Really? Paimon thought it was the other way around... Either way, have some more confidence! In fact, that's a proper name for a potion...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390736
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390736,
					"content": "Mm, thanks. Anyway... This potion's different from the previous two, so it might be very dangerous... So please, come to my workshop.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390737
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390737,
					"content": "If we're in the sea, the environment should help moderate the potion's effects, and my workshop has tools to deal with the dangers, so...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390738
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390738,
					"content": "Wow, this one sounds like a real doozy...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390739
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390739,
					"content": "Let's begin, then.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390740
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740390740,
					"content": "Alright. Follow me!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390731,
					"content": "You mean 180 degrees, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390732
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740390723,
					"content": "Well, we've gotten this far...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390724
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740390724,
					"content": "Exactly! What would the point of all this be if we gave up halfway? That said... It's not like Paimon's not worried or anything, but...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390725
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390710,
					"content": "Don't worry, Pyro Slimes are weak.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390711
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740390711,
					"content": "Heh... Wait, no, it's just that you're too strong!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390712,
					"content": "Hmmm. Wait... Did you just say \"Pyro Slimes\"?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390713
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390713,
					"content": "Oh! That's right... We actually only saw a bunch of huge crabs!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390714,
						740390716
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390714,
					"content": "Crabs? Yes, it's normal to see crabs near the coast.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390715
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740390715,
					"content": "But you really weren't normal just now!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390720
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390716,
					"content": "But the burning sensation was very real. I could even feel the heat waves coming from them...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390717
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740390717,
					"content": "I see... Um, hallucinogenic effects... Alright, I've written it down. Well, at least it wasn't completely ineffective, but... *sigh*",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390718
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390718,
					"content": "Regardless, it's great that you're alright! It's just that... Sorry, the potion didn't work again...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390719
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390719,
					"content": "#It's fine! Anyway... Even though it smells terrible, it's at least half successful. You see, {NICKNAME} was totally fine even after drinking it!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390720
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
