						"position": [
							2515.588,
							415.68,
							4525.956
						],
						"pointId": 4563
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 740390801,
					"content": "Here! This is my workshop, where I conduct my experiments!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390802,
					"content": "Okay, now for the next experiment, we'll be testing the Truesight Potion! Are you ready?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390803,
					"content": "I'm ready.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390804
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740390804,
					"content": "Oooh... Please be careful...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390805,
					"content": "You take the potion from Verenata, and the rank odor of masses of dead Seagrass left to rot under the tropical sun assaults your nostrils, causing you to gag involuntarily...\\nYou hesitate for a moment, and then drain it in a single gulp. The taste of the potion itself isn't nearly so awful, and in fact, it really lacks any kind of distinct taste...\\nOtherwise, however, your body has no reaction to it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390806
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740390806,
					"content": "Afterwards, you rest for a while at her instruction. Absolutely nothing changes during that time.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390807
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740390807,
					"content": "But not long after...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390808
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740390808,
					"content": "It looks like nothing has changed... Phew, Paimon can stop worrying now...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390809,
					"content": "#Yes, but... {NICKNAME}, you look like you were stunned for a moment. What's wrong? Did you see something?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390810,
					"content": "I saw... half of a semi-transparent boat?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390811
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740390811,
					"content": "Really? Fascinating! But... um... can you provide a more detailed description?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390812,
						740390815
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390812,
					"content": "It was too far away, I couldn't see clearly.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390813
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740390813,
					"content": "How very interesting, yes indeed! ...But it cannot serve as concrete proof of the potion's effects... You can't prove that you didn't mistake some reef or shipwreck for a \"ghost ship,\" after all...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390814,
					"content": "So... *sigh* The results of this experiment are inconclusive.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390818
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390818,
					"content": "Thanks to you both, I've collected a great many awesome notes this time! I'll definitely be able to use them for the next batch of potions!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390819
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390819,
					"content": "Hmm... \"Though I've heard something very familiar...\" Yes, \"But there's still so much to observe, to see if others can see the same phenomenon\"...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390820
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390820,
					"content": "Uh? Does that mean that you still need to find other people to help you test your potions?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390821
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390821,
					"content": "Yes, that's correct. Because... um... I must have two or more reliable witnesses who see the same thing in order to prove that the potion really can allow people to see the \"truth,\" right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390822
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390822,
					"content": "The \"truth\" will not be limited or constrained by the eyes and perspectives of the viewer, and won't be distorted by what is in their heart... It objectively exists there, and it just is.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390823
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390823,
					"content": "Hmmm... like... like gods that live for thousands of years?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390824
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390824,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390825
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390825,
					"content": "No. Like the white sand, like the bones of seastars, like the waves that crash and pound... those are \"truth.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390826
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390826,
					"content": "But the Master Potioneer has also said... that \"truth\" can also be created through dreams and memories. I don't quite get it, and it seems like a contradiction to me... but I'm trying my best to understand.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390827
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390827,
					"content": "Wow... The topic got so deep so quickly...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390828
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390828,
					"content": "Haha, then let's not talk about such things for now! Anyway, I'd like to thank you for your help! Please, take these!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390829
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390829,
					"content": "Hmm... Also, be sure to come back again next time I make a new potion!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390815,
					"content": "It looked like it had been cut in half by something huge...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390816
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740390816,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390817
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390817,
					"content": "Ah! Sorry! I... must have drifted off for a second there. But... but I've already written it all down. Thank you very much!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390818
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Verenata"
				}
			]
		},
